    <unit id="CanvasHelp">
      <segment>
        <source>Arrow keys move between steps, Alt with an arrow follows the connections, Enter opens a step, plus and minus zoom, Shift+1 fits the workflow.</source>
        <target state="translated">方向鍵在步驟間移動，Alt 加方向鍵沿連線移動，Enter 開啟步驟，加號和減號縮放，Shift+1 符合視窗。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="CanvasHelpEditable">
      <segment>
        <source>Arrow keys move between steps, Alt with an arrow follows the connections, Enter opens a step, Space selects, M moves the selected steps, C connects the focused step, Delete removes the selection, Ctrl+C and Ctrl+V copy and paste, Ctrl+Z undoes, plus and minus zoom, Shift+1 fits the workflow.</source>
        <target state="translated">方向鍵在步驟間移動，Alt 加方向鍵沿連線移動，Enter 開啟步驟，空白鍵選取，M 移動選取的步驟，C 連接焦點步驟，Delete 刪除選取內容，Ctrl+C 和 Ctrl+V 複製與貼上，Ctrl+Z 復原，加號和減號縮放，Shift+1 符合視窗。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
